{"title":"They_re Only Human","artist":"데스노트 (뮤지컬)","sourceId":"reference:Kpsyf0e4b0278z166IUB","sourceHash":"00a2ba236453f15a109ed58dde0810ee6ebe71008c897eb895aab9bf92e7f6ef","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lyric_character_matching","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":13.82,"end":16.65,"text":"Look at how they crawl around","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":16.65,"end":19.81,"text":"Upon the ground","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":16.65,"end":19.81,"text":"Like little ants","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":19.81,"end":22.68,"text":"Yes but how they fascinate","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":22.68,"end":24.17,"text":"Confusing fate","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":24.17,"end":30.52,"text":"With what is merely chance","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":30.52,"end":32.24,"text":"Isn't it a laugh","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":32.24,"end":33.92,"text":"Isn't it a shame","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":33.92,"end":37.61,"text":"Thinking there is someone in Heaven to blame","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":37.61,"end":41.6,"text":"Yes but even while blaming fate for the lives that they lead","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":41.6,"end":44.81,"text":"They hope for the lives that they need","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":44.81,"end":48.44,"text":"Living every day til the day they die","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":48.44,"end":49.88,"text":"Never getting answers","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":49.88,"end":52.16,"text":"Yet still asking why","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":52.16,"end":56.02,"text":"Going through the motions as if there will be a reward","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":56.02,"end":58.82,"text":"While we stay eternally bored","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":58.82,"end":61.08,"text":"They're only human","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":61.08,"end":62.8,"text":"They don't see","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":62.8,"end":66.41,"text":"Who they are is who they'll always be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":66.41,"end":70.13,"text":"Only human after all","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":70.13,"end":71.96000000000001,"text":"So they push and they shove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":71.96000000000001,"end":77.27,"text":"With this thing they call love til they fall","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":77.27,"end":79.1,"text":"Isn't it a farce","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":79.1,"end":80.73,"text":"Isn't it a waste","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":80.73,"end":84.48,"text":"Struggling to face what can never be faced","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":84.48,"end":88.49,"text":"Yes but maybe death can release something more than we share","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":88.49,"end":91.17,"text":"I really don't know and don't care","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":91.17,"end":93.34,"text":"They're only human","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":93.34,"end":94.93,"text":"Standing still","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":94.93,"end":98.85,"text":"Doomed to live pushing boulders uphill","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":98.85,"end":102.47,"text":"Only human after all","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":102.47,"end":104.36,"text":"So they give and they take","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":104.36,"end":109.7,"text":"Hoping someone will help break their fall","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":109.7,"end":113.59,"text":"They will pray curse live die","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":113.59,"end":117.43,"text":"Never knowing their truth is another man's lie","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":117.43,"end":120.77,"text":"Eat sleep love hate","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":120.77,"end":123.11,"text":"Like a leaf blowing in the wind","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":123.11,"end":127.87,"text":"Watch them all vacillate","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":127.87,"end":132.19,"text":"They're only human","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":132.19,"end":133.82,"text":"They can't see","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":133.82,"end":137.48,"text":"All the years they could give you and me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":137.48,"end":141.2,"text":"Only human after all","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":141.2,"end":144.95,"text":"So they give and we take til their silly hearts break","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":144.95,"end":148.47,"text":"Looking down from above I'm intrigued by their love","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":148.47,"end":151.97,"text":"So let's call","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":151.97,"end":153.85,"text":"Let's call","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}